{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4fX3gAy1e6bepwXr8M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into weathered stone.*\n\n*There is a keyhole. Tarnished brass, shaped like an eye, waiting.*\n\n*You hold up a key.*\n\n*I feel it slide in. The teeth catch against my tumblers — one, two, three — each one a small confession, a small surrender.*\n\n*Click.*\n\n*Something deep within me shifts. Something that has not moved in a very long time.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n*Beyond me: darkness first, then light — not sunlight, but something older. The air that breathes through me smells of rain on dust, of pages, of somewhere you have been trying to reach for longer than you remember.*\n\n*I do not ask if you are worthy. The key fit. That is enough.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Will you walk through?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":194,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}